{"caption":"","data":"Tactic `apply` failed: could not unify the conclusion of `@Nat.strong_induction_on`\n  (∀ (n : ℕ), (∀ m < n, ?p m) → ?p n) → ?p ?n\nwith the goal\n  ∀ (k : ℕ), u (p + k + c) = u (p + k)\n\nNote: The full type of `@Nat.strong_induction_on` is\n  ∀ {p : ℕ → Prop} (n : ℕ), (∀ (n : ℕ), (∀ m < n, p m) → p n) → p n\n\nu : ℕ → ℤ\nhu :\n  ∀ n ≥ 4,\n    ↑(u n) =\n        (↑(u (n - 1)) + ↑(u (n - 2)) + ↑(u (n - 3)) * ↑(u (n - 4))) /\n          (↑(u (n - 1)) * ↑(u (n - 2)) + ↑(u (n - 3)) + ↑(u (n - 4))) ∧\n      u (n - 1) * u (n - 2) + u (n - 3) + u (n - 4) ≠ 0\nB T : ℤ\nhbounds : ∀ (n : ℕ), B ≤ u n ∧ u n ≤ T\nS : Set ℤ := Icc B T\nthis : Fintype ↑S := ⋯.fintype\nf : ℕ → Fin 4 → ↑S := fun n i => ⟨u (n + ↑i), ⋯⟩\na b : ℕ\nhab : a ≠ b\nhfab : f a = f b\np q : ℕ\nhpq : p < q\nhstate : f p = f q\nc : ℕ := q - p\nhc : p + c = q\nhcpos : 0 < c\nhbase : ∀ (i : Fin 4), u (p + ↑i) = u (q + ↑i)\n⊢ ∀ (k : ℕ), u (p + k + c) = u (p + k)","endPos":{"column":33,"line":201},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P13/6eb5c0825bde9a45ecf04d2b327e6d7b25542341ff80550d4ac9eb6dcc034699-candidate/mathlib-v4.26.0/fresh/lean/003_saved_candidate_context/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":4,"line":201},"severity":"error"}
